# EmailJS configuration (https://www.emailjs.com)
# 1. Create a free EmailJS account and an email service (e.g. Gmail).
# 2. Create an email template with variables: from_name, from_email, subject, message, company, project_type
# 3. Copy your Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key below.
# 4. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the real values — .env is gitignored.

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
